{
  "title": "The Return of the 8th Class Mage",
  "description": "As a powerful 8th class mage, Ian Paige took countless innocent lives under the orders of Emperor Ragnar, a close friend and ruler of the Greenriver Empire. Yet despite their closeness, Ragnar views Ian as a threat and subsequently poisons him. Using time magic, Ian saves himself and returns 30 years to the past. Now a young boy, Ian joins an elite order of mages to hone his abilities once again. This time, he’ll get revenge on the emperor who betrayed him and reclaim glory as an 8th class mage!\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Academy, Action, Alchemists, Alchemy, Assassins, Based on a Novel, Black/Dark Magic, Calm Protagonist, Conspiracy, Elaborate, Fantasy, Fantasy Creature, Fantasy World, Female Lead Falls in Love First, Genius, Genius Protagonist, Hidden Talent, Kings, Knight, Mature Protagonist, Memories, Nobility, Past Life, Politicians, Politics Involving Royalty, Potion, Primarily Adult Cast, Prince, Princess, Prodigy, Reincarnation, Shounen, Smart Male Lead, Social Gap, Special Ability, Teachers, Time Manipulation, Time Skip, Time Skip In First Chapter/Prologue, Traumatic Past, Age Regression, Appearance Different from Actual Age, Based on a Web Novel, Beautiful Female Lead, Betrayal, Coming of Age, Europe, European Ambience, Family Life, Full Color, Heterosexual, Long-Haired Male Character, Long-Haired Male Lead, Longstrip, Mages, Magic, Magic School, Maids, Male Lead, Male Protagonist, Manhwa, Master-Servant Relationship, Military, Murder, Orc, Overpowered Protagonist, Politics, Protagonist Strong from the Start, Revenge, Romantic Subplot, Royalty, School, Sci-Fi, Second Chance, Selfish Protagonist, Slice of Life, Smart Protagonist, Subtle Romance, Swordplay, Time Rewind, Time Travel, Web Comic, Goblin, Mind control, Time Skip In Final Chapter/Epilogue",
